WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.257
Unit two. Washing My Hands!

2
00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:07.960
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:11.299
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.349 --> 00:00:15.059
Today we learn about Washing My Hands. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.973 --> 00:00:19.073
Soap. Say it with me. Soap!

6
00:00:22.597 --> 00:00:25.880
Water. Say it with me. Water!

7
00:00:29.382 --> 00:00:32.749
Germs. Say it with me. Germs!

8
00:00:36.248 --> 00:00:39.598
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

9
00:00:43.081 --> 00:00:46.531
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

10
00:00:50.039 --> 00:00:53.456
Dirty. Say it with me. Dirty!

11
00:00:56.965 --> 00:01:00.298
Towel. Say it with me. Towel!

12
00:01:03.794 --> 00:01:07.194
Sink. Say it with me. Sink!

13
00:01:10.702 --> 00:01:18.822
I wash my hands with soap and water before I eat. Washing removes germs and dirt from my hands. I always dry my hands with a clean towel.

14
00:01:18.872 --> 00:01:20.057
I can do that too!

15
00:01:21.292 --> 00:01:26.525
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:26.575 --> 00:01:27.725
Germs!

17
00:01:28.615 --> 00:01:33.913
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:33.963 --> 00:01:35.113
Towel!

19
00:01:35.933 --> 00:01:45.057
Did you know? Washing your hands with soap for 20 seconds — about as long as singing 'Happy Birthday' twice — washes most germs away!

20
00:01:45.107 --> 00:01:47.184
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.883 --> 00:01:55.286
Think and answer. When should you wash your hands?

22
00:01:55.336 --> 00:01:56.486
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.582 --> 00:02:02.307
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.357 --> 00:02:04.883
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

